    <description>This package is deprecated as of Studio 23.10. 
Integration Service Connectors can now be used directly from the Project's Activities panel or Package Manager under All Connectors.
    
THIS VERSION REQUIRES A CLOUD INTEGRATION SERVICE. UiPath Integration Service based automation activities for Act! 365. These activities allow you to execute create, retrieve, update, delete and invoke operations on Act! 365 objects.</description>
